<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Surya Semesta plans to float shares.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Surya Semesta plans to float shares.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian property firm PT Surya Semesta Internusa said on Monday the firm planned to be listed on the domestic bourse this year.</p>
<p>Surya Semesta said in a statement it would float 135 million shares at a par value of 500 rupiah, or 20 percent, of its paid-up capital. It said more details would be released soon.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
